{"id":"n50002-2-7","stage":4,"title":"막바지 · 尽头","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n50002-2-7-1","ko":"더 이상 길이 없네요?","zh":"没有路可走了吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이상","meaning":"到此结束，结束","explanation":"이상：到此结束，结束","readings":[{"term":"이상","audio":"/audio/e6e77b83100b28e797f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66580","senseId":"4","lemma":"이상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"길이","meaning":"路，路途","explanation":"길：路，路途；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"3","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없네요?","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"e6e77b83100b28e7","term":"이상","zh":"到此结束，结束","audio":"/audio/e6e77b83100b28e797f1.mp3","entryId":"66580","definition":"文件或演讲等在最后使用，表示“结束”的意思。","pronunciation":["이ː상"]},{"id":"d72c843458543667","term":"길","zh":"路，路途","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3","entryId":"59251","definition":"为了到达一定目的地而经过的空间。","pronunciation":["길"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/a46512671285332d98f9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n50002-2-7-2","ko":"네, 여기가 산책로의 막바지 지점이니 이젠 되돌아갑시다.","zh":"是的，这里就是步道的尽头了，我们现在回去吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여기가","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"산책로의","meaning":"散步道、步道","explanation":"산책로：散步道、步道；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"산책로","audio":"/audio/12f5cb252cac5fd6fc68.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:산책로:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"산책로","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"막바지","meaning":"尽头","explanation":"막바지：尽头","readings":[{"term":"막바지","audio":"/audio/743ea47390971c5ac72f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50002","senseId":"2","lemma":"막바지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지점이니","meaning":"地点","explanation":"지점：地点；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"지점","audio":"/audio/66c785ce1f5d42b62f31.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71489","senseId":"1","lemma":"지점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이젠","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"1","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되돌아갑시다.","meaning":"回去，返回","explanation":"되돌아가다：回去，返回；ㅂ시다：较正式的提议句末：“一起……吧”，通常用于平辈或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"되돌아가다","audio":"/audio/5577e2eb131762a08c93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14923","senseId":"1","lemma":"되돌아가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"12f5cb252cac5fd6","term":"산책로","zh":"散步道、步道","audio":"/audio/12f5cb252cac5fd6fc68.mp3","definition":"供人散步的道路。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"743ea47390971c5a","term":"막바지","zh":"尽头","audio":"/audio/743ea47390971c5ac72f.mp3","entryId":"50002","definition":"前方不通的地方。","pronunciation":["막빠지"]},{"id":"66c785ce1f5d42b6","term":"지점","zh":"地点","audio":"/audio/66c785ce1f5d42b62f31.mp3","entryId":"71489","definition":"某个区域内的特定地方。","pronunciation":["지점"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"说话的同时。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"5577e2eb131762a0","term":"되돌아가다","zh":"回去，返回","audio":"/audio/5577e2eb131762a08c93.mp3","entryId":"14923","definition":"重新回到原来的地方。","pronunciation":["되도라가다","뒈도라가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c17afa7b086bc1f7aafa.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.97,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=50002","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":142,"sequenceScore":2.7967,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是的，这里就是步道的尽头了，我们现在回去吧。","没有路可走了吧？","你开车的速度是不是太快了？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["没有路可走了吧？","你开车的速度是不是太快了？","是的，这里就是步道的尽头了，我们现在回去吧。"],"answer":2}]}
